hadiths[37]{hadithnumber,text}:
"612","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah Ansari [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hunain wale saal nikle; jab ham mile [dushman se] to Musalmanon mein bhagdad mach gayi. Ravi kehte hain: Main ne ek mushrik ko dekha jo ek Musalman par chadh aaya tha; main us ke liye ghooma yahan tak ke us ke peeche aaya yahan tak ke main ne us ke kandhe ki rag par war kiya. To woh meri taraf mutawajjah hua aur mujhe zor se bhincha yahan tak ke main ne us se maut ki boo pai; phir use maut aa gayi; us ne mujhe chhor diya. To main Umar bin Khattab se mila; main ne kaha: Logon ka kya haal hai. Unhon ne kaha: Allah Azz wa Jall ka hukm. Phir log wapas aae. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo maqtool ko qatl kare jis par us ke paas daleel ho, us ke liye us ka salb [us ke jism ka maal] hai.' To main khada hua aur kaha: Mere liye kaun gawahi dega? Phir main baith gaya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo maqtool ko qatl kare jis par us ke paas daleel ho, us ke liye us ka salb hai.' To main khada hua aur kaha: Mere liye kaun gawahi dega? Phir main baith gaya. Phir Aap ne teesri martaba farmaya; main khada hua. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ai Abu Qatadah, tumhara kya mamla hai?' To main ne Aap ko qissa sunaya. To qaum mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Sach kaha Ya Rasulullah; us maqtool ka salb mere paas hai; use mujh se razi farmayen [mujhe de den badle mein]. Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam; phir Allah ke sheron mein se sher jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki taraf se ladta hai, us ka salb tumhen de diya jae. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us ne sach kaha; use use de do.' Abu Qatadah kehte hain: To us ne mujhe diya; main ne zirha bechi; us se Banu Salamah mein khajoor ka bagh khareeda; woh Islam mein mera pehla maal hai jo main ne jama kiya. Malik kehte hain: Mikhraf yani khajoor [ka bagh]. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka salb Abu Qatadah ko us ke iqrar se dena jis ke hath mein tha dalil hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke farman: 'Jo maqtool ko qatl kare jis par us ke paas daleel ho, us ke liye us ka salb hai' ka matlab sirf hai: Jo maqtool ko qatl kare aur us ke paas salb ho jis par us muddai ke hath [qabza] nahin jo dawa karta hai ke woh us ka qatil hai. Aur us mein woh hai jo dalalat karta hai ke imam jab kahe: Jo maqtool ko qatl kare us ke liye us ka salb hai; us ka salb ek aadmi ke hath mein paya gaya aur us ne kaha: Woh us maqtool ka salb hai jise main ne qatl kiya, aur yeh sirf us ke qaul se maloom ho; us mein qaul us ka hai. Aur Abu Qatadah ke qaul se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka us par nakir tark farmana: Mere liye kaun gawahi dega; dalil hai ke gawah gawah hota hai jo us ne jana agarche use woh mashhud lahu talab na kare."
"613","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salamah bin Akwa [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek ghazwah mein the jo ham ne lada; ek jasus aaya; Salamah bin Akwa ne use qatl kiya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us aadmi ko kis ne qatl kiya?' Unhon ne kaha: Salamah bin Akwa. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us ke liye us ka sara salb hai.'"
"614","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fath wale saal Makkah mein dakhil hue jabke Aap ke sar par lohe ka top tha; jab use utara to Aap ke paas ek aadmi aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Ibn Khatal Ka'ba ke pardo se lipta hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use qatl karo.'"
"615","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Taif walon ka muhasra farmaya; Aap ke munadi ne pukara: 'Jo ghulam hamare paas nikle woh aazad hai.' To Aap ke paas Nafi aur Nufai nikle; Aap ne dono ko aazad farmaya. Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Samti behtareen mein se aadmi the; un ki hadees mein zo'f hai."
"616","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Khaibar ki taraf gae; ham raat mein wahan pahunche. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab raat mein kisi qaum ke paas jate to un par subah se pehle hamla nahin farmate; agar azan sunte to ruk jate; agar woh namaz na padhte to un par subah ke waqt hamla farmate. Ravi kehte hain: Jab ham ne subah ki to Aap sawar hue aur Musalman sawar hue; basti wale nikle un ke sath un ki tokriyan aur kudalen thin. Jab unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha to kaha: Muhammad aur lashkar. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allahu Akbar, Khaibar barbad; beshak jab ham kisi qaum ke maidan mein utarte hain to daraye gaon ki subah buri hoti hai.' Anas kehte hain: Main Abu Talhah ke peeche sawar tha; mere dono paon Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke qadam ko chhute the."
"617","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Khaibar wale saal nikle; ham ne maal ghanimat mein sona aur na chandi payi siwae maal [oont bakriyan], kapdon aur saman ke. Ravi kehte hain: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Wadil-Qura ki taraf mutawajjah hue; un ka gumaan hai ke Rifa'ah bin Zaid ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko siyah ghulam tohfe mein diya jise Mid'am kaha jata tha. Ravi kehte hain: To ham nikle yahan tak ke jab ham Wadil-Qura mein the; jabke Mid'am Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka kajawa utar raha tha ke achanak us ke paas gumrah teer aaya aur use laga; us ne use qatl kiya. To logon ne kaha: Us ke liye jannat mubarak. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hargiz nahin; qasam Us ki jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, beshak woh chadar jo us ne Khaibar wale din ghanimat mein se li jabke taqseem us par nahin padi thi, us par aag bhadak rahi hai.'"
"618","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid Juhani [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Khaibar mein the; Ashja ka ek aadmi faut hua; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki namaz janaza nahin padhi. Aap ne farmaya: 'Apne sathi ki namaz padho.' To unhon ne us ke saman mein dekha; unhon ne us mein Yahud ke motiyon mein se moti paae jo do dirham ke barabar nahin the."
"619","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid Juhani [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se Ashja ka ek aadmi Khaibar wale din faut hua; unhon ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To un ka gumaan hai ke Aap ne un se farmaya: 'Apne sathi ki namaz padho.' To logon ke chehre is se badal gae. To un ka gumaan hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak tumhara sathi Allah ke raste mein [maal ghanimat mein] khayanat karne wala hai.' To ham ne us ke saman ki talashi li; ham ne Yahud ke motiyon mein se moti paae; Allah ki qasam do dirham ke barabar nahin the."
"620","[AI-translation] Hazrat Urwah bin Abi Al-Ja'd Bariqi [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Ghode us ki peshaniyon mein qayamat tak khair bandhi hui hai.' Shabib kehte hain: Main ne Urwah ke ghar sattar ghode bandhe dekhe."
"621","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ghode us ki peshaniyon mein qayamat tak khair bandhi hui hai.'"
"622","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Muhajireen aur Ansar mein hamare ghar mein muakhat farmai. To un se kaha gaya: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nahin farmaya: 'Islam mein [Jahiliyat ka] half nahin'? To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Muhajireen aur Ansar mein hamare ghar mein muakhat farmai. Sufyan kehte hain: Ulama ne is ki tafseer farmai: Un mein bhai chara farmaya."
"623","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubadah bin Samit [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath majlis mein the; Aap ne ham se farmaya: 'Meri bai'at karo ke Allah ke sath kisi ko shareek na karoge'; Aap ne un par ayat padhi... Tum mein se jo pura kare us ka ajr Allah par hai; jo us mein se kuch kare aur us par use saza di jae woh us ke liye kaffara hai; jo us mein se kuch kare aur Allah us par us ka parda rakhe woh Allah ki taraf hai: Agar chahe use bakhsh de; agar chahe use azab de."
"624","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunne aur ita'at par bai'at karte to Aap ham se farmate: 'Jitna tum taqat rakho.'"
"625","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubadah bin Samit [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunne aur ita'at par tangi aur aasani, chaah aur na-pasand mein bai'at ki, mamle [hukumat] walon se mamla na chhinenge, ham haq ke sath khade honge, ya kahenge, Allah mein malamat karne wale ki malamat se nahin darenge."
"626","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubadah bin Samit [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se chhe par [ehd] liya jaise aurton se liya: 'Ke Allah ke sath kisi ko shareek na karoge, chori na karoge, zina na karoge, apni auladon ko qatl na karoge, tum mein se ba'z ba'z par tohmat na lagayen, aur meri na-farmani na karoge us neki mein jis ka main tumhen hukm dun. Tum mein se jo un mein se ek kare aur us ki saza jald di jae woh us ka kaffara hai; jis ki saza moakhkhar ki jae, us ka mamla Allah Azz wa Jall ki taraf hai: Agar chahe use azab de; agar chahe use bakhsh de.' Tahawi ne ham ko bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Main ne Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ko farmate suna: Jo apne bhai par jhoot bole us ne us par tohmat lagai."
"627","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne Uhud wale din pesh kiya gaya jabke main chaudah saal ka tha; Aap ne mujhe ijazat nahin di. Mujhe Aap ke samne pesh kiya gaya jabke main pandrah saal ka tha; Aap ne mujhe Khandaq wale din ijazat di."
"628","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aisi hi riwayat hai."
"629","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham ko Najd ki taraf sariyah mein bheja; ham mein se har aadmi ka hissa barah oont hua; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham ko ek ek oont izafi diya."
"630","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Najd ki taraf sariyah bheja jis mein Abdullah bin Umar the; unhen bahut oont ghanimat mile; un ke hisse barah oont ya gyarah oont hue; phir unhen ek ek oont izafi diya gaya."
"631","[AI-translation] Iyas bin Salamah [Rahimahullah] se, Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Mera khayal hai un ke walid [Salamah bin Akwa Raziyallahu anhu] se, riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath ek ghazwah mein the jisme Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen ham par ameer banaya tha; ham ne shabashi ki; Abu Bakr ne ham ko hukm diya; ham ne dushman par Subah ki namaz mein hamla kiya. To ham us ke paas qaidi lekar aae; Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mujhe qaidiyon mein se khubsurat bandi izafi di jo logon mein sab se khubsurat thi. Main ne Madinah pahunchne tak us ka kapda nahin khola. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bazaar mein mila. Aap ne farmaya: 'Bandi mujhe hibah karo.' To main ne kaha: Ai Nabi Allah, woh mujhe pasand aayi hai; main ne us ka kapda nahin khola. Ravi kehte hain: Aap khamosh rahe. Jab raat hui woh mere paas rahi; main ne us ka kapda nahin khola. Jab subah hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mujhe bazaar mein mile. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Bandi mujhe hibah karo, tumhare walid par Allah ki rehmat!' To main ne kaha: Woh tumhari hai Ai Rasulullah; Allah ki qasam main ne us ka kapda nahin khola. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use Makkah bheja; Aap ne us se Musalman qaidiyon ka fidya diya jo mushrikon ke hathon mein the."
"632","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Quran lekar dushman ki zameen safar na karo; mujhe andesha hai ke dushman use pa le.'"
"633","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Quran lekar dushman ki zameen safar karne se mana farmaya."
"634","[AI-translation] Ka'b bin Malik ke bete [Rahimahullah] se apne chacha [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aurton aur bachchon ke qatl se mana farmaya jab Ibn Abi Al-Huqaiq ki taraf bheja."
"635","[AI-translation] Hazrat Atiyyah Qurazi [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham ko Quraizah wale din pesh farmaya; ham mein se jo [zeer naf] baal ugaye use qatl farmaya; jo na ugaye use zinda rakha aur qaidi banaya."
"636","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b [bin Malik Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar ke zamane mein mana farmaya ke chhota bachcha ya aurat qatl ki jae."
"637","[AI-translation] Malik bin Aus bin Hadatsan (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: 'Beshak Banu Nazir ke maal us mein se the jo Allah ne Apne Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko fai ke taur par diye jin par Musalmanon ne ghode aur na oont daudaye the; un ke maal Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye khaas the. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un mein se apne ghar walon par saal bhar ka kharch farmate; jo bachta use ghode aur hathiyar mein Allah ke raste ki taiyari mein lagate.'"
"638","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mere waris deenar taqseem nahin karenge; jo main ne apne ghar walon ke kharch aur apne karkun ki ujrat ke ba'd chhora, woh sadqa hai. Mere waris deenar taqseem nahin karenge.'"
"639","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ham [Anbiya] ka wirsa nahin hota; jo ham chhoren woh sadqa hai.'"
"640","[AI-translation] Malik bin Aus bin Hadatsan (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Usman bin Affan, Abdur Rahman bin Auf, Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas, Talhah aur Zubair (Raziyallahu anhum) se qasam lete suna. Unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun jis ke izn se aasman aur zameen qayem hain: Kya tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Ham [Anbiya] ka wirsa nahin hota; jo ham chhoren woh sadqa hai'? Unhon ne kaha: Ji."
"641","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghodon mein daud farmai; Aap ne tayyar [muzammar] ko Hafya se Saniyatul-Wada tak bheja; ghair tayyar ko Saniyatul-Wada se Masjid Banu Zuraiq tak."
"642","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Muqabla nahin siwae sandal [teer andazi], ya khur [ghode], ya [oont ke] paon [mein].'"
"643","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Muqabla nahin siwae khur [ghode] ya [oont ke] paon [mein].'"
"644","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tayyar ghodon mein Hafya se daud farmai; us ki had Saniyatul-Wada thi. Aap ne ghair tayyar ghodon mein Saniyah se Masjid Banu Zuraiq tak daud farmai. Aur Abdullah bin Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) un mein the jo us mein daud lagate."
"645","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki oontni Azba kahlati thi; woh peeche nahin rehti thi. To dehati apne oont par aaya; us ne us se daud lagai; woh us se aage badh gaya. Yeh Musalmanon par bhari hua. Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jo un ke chehron mein tha dekha to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Azba peeche reh gayi! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah Azz wa Jall par haq hai ke duniya ki kisi cheez ko buland na farmaye magar use neecha farmaye.'"
"646","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Qatadah se apne walid [Abu Qatadah Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, bataiye agar main apni is talwar se Allah ke raste mein sabr karte, sawab chahte, aage badhte peeche nahin hatte ladun to kya Allah mujh se meri khatayen mita dega? Aap ne farmaya: 'Ji.' Jab woh peeth pher kar gaya to farmaya: 'Aao; yeh Jibreel (Alaihis-salam) kehte hain: Siwae is ke ke tum par qarz ho.'"
"647","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Qatadah Ansari se apne walid [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, agar main Allah ke raste mein sabr karte, sawab chahte, aage badhte peeche nahin hatte qatl kiya jaon to kya Allah mujh se meri khatayen mita dega? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ji.' Jab woh aadmi peeth pher kar gaya to Aap ne use pukara ya us ke bare mein hukm diya aur use pukara gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum ne kya kaha?' To us ne Aap par qaul dohraya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Ji, siwae qarz ke; aise hi Jibreel (Alaihis-salam) ne mujh se kaha.'"
"648","[AI-translation] Aswad bin Qais (Rahimahullah) se apni qaum ke ek aadmi se jis ka naam Sair bin Alqamah [Raziyallahu anhu] hai, riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Qadisiyah ki jang mein ek aadmi se kushti ladi jis ka saman barah hazar tak pahuncha; Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas ne woh sara mujhe izafi diya."
